PN,41801
SC,0001
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F418A1785327526
OL,3,CCare worker sentenced for sending
OL,4,Cdegrading Snapchat images of dementia
OL,5,Cpatients
OL,7,FA care worker who took degrading
OL,8,Fpictures of dementia patients and sent
OL,9,Fthem on Snapchat has been handed a
OL,10,Fprobation order and given 100 hours of
OL,11,Fcommunity service.
OL,13,FCiara Corvan, 28, committed the
OL,14,Foffences while working as a healthcare
OL,15,Fassistant at a specialist ward for
OL,16,Fdementia patients at the Bluestone
OL,17,FUnit at Craigavon Area Hospital.
OL,1,W~k4 jw=hw1 hw}h7}j7}            G1/16
OL,2,W/*% /*%/"-$+,*%/*%/*-'T(,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BNI NewsCClean Feed FThis Day
FL,419,410,140,120,000,100
PN,41802
SC,0002
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F418A1785327526
OL,3,CCare worker sentenced for sending
OL,4,Cdegrading Snapchat images of dementia
OL,5,Cpatients
OL,7,FPassing sentence at Craigavon Crown
OL,8,FCourt on Monday, Judge Patrick
OL,9,FMcGurgan said Corvan, from Cathedrals
OL,10,FView in Armagh, had failed to treat
OL,11,Fpatients in her care with the respect
OL,12,Fand dignity to which they were
OL,13,Fentitled.
OL,1,W~k4 jw=hw1 hw}h7}j7}            G2/16
OL,2,W/*% /*%/"-$+,*%/*%/*-'T(,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BNI NewsCClean Feed FThis Day
FL,419,410,140,120,000,100
PN,41803
SC,0003
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F418A1785327526
OL,3,CCare worker sentenced for sending
OL,4,Cdegrading Snapchat images of dementia
OL,5,Cpatients
OL,7,FAmong the images Corvan sent to co-
OL,8,Fworkers on Snapchat was a picture of a
OL,9,Ffemale patient in the bath; a video of
OL,10,Fher shaking a patient's hand while
OL,11,Fmusic played in the background with a
OL,12,Fcaption claiming she was having a
OL,13,F"rave"; and a picture of her and a
OL,14,Fpatient with their noses almost
OL,15,Ftouching with the caption "why the
OL,16,Ff*** is she so close to me?".
OL,18,FEarlier this year Corvan plead guilty
OL,19,Fto a total of seven counts of ill
OL,20,Ftreatment of patients under the Mental
OL,21,FHealth Order (NI) 1986.
OL,26,@uD@AOUuD@FO]wD@[OUxD@\O]
OL,1,W~k4 jw=hw1 hw}h7}j7}            G3/16
OL,2,W/*% /*%/"-$+,*%/*%/*-'T(,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BNI NewsCClean Feed FThis Day
FL,419,410,140,120,000,100
PN,41804
SC,0004
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F418A1785327526
OL,3,CCare worker sentenced for sending
OL,4,Cdegrading Snapchat images of dementia
OL,5,Cpatients
OL,7,FThe offences, which covered the period
OL,8,Ffrom the autumn of 2022 to the summer
OL,9,Fof 2023, involved four dementia
OL,10,Fpatients being cared for on the ward.
OL,11,FAll four have since died.
OL,13,FPolice said the case was the first
OL,14,Fprosecution of its kind in Northern
OL,15,FIreland.
OL,17,FJudge McGurgan told Corvan her crimes
OL,18,Fwere committed while she was in a
OL,19,Fposition of trust.
OL,1,W~k4 jw=hw1 hw}h7}j7}            G4/16
OL,2,W/*% /*%/"-$+,*%/*%/*-'T(,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BNI NewsCClean Feed FThis Day
FL,419,410,140,120,000,100
PN,41805
SC,0005
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F418A1785327526
OL,3,CCare worker sentenced for sending
OL,4,Cdegrading Snapchat images of dementia
OL,5,Cpatients
OL,7,F"You were employed to provide care for
OL,8,Fsome of the most vulnerable members of
OL,9,Four society," he said.
OL,11,F"It is a hard enough decision, in my
OL,12,Fview, for a family to make to place a
OL,13,Floved one in a care setting,
OL,14,Fparticularly when that loved one is as
OL,15,Fvulnerable as the victims were in this
OL,16,Fcase.
OL,18,F"The very least families can expect is
OL,19,Fthat those who are entrusted to care
OL,20,Ffor their loved ones are treated with
OL,21,Frespect and dignity.
OL,26,@oD@AOUqD@MO]sD@AOUzD@AOU
OL,1,W~k4 jw=hw1 hw}h7}j7}            G5/16
OL,2,W/*% /*%/"-$+,*%/*%/*-'T(,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BNI NewsCClean Feed FThis Day
FL,419,410,140,120,000,100
PN,41806
SC,0006
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F418A1785327526
OL,3,CCare worker sentenced for sending
OL,4,Cdegrading Snapchat images of dementia
OL,5,Cpatients
OL,7,F"You, Ms Corvan, failed to do that."
OL,9,FThe judge praised the actions of the
OL,10,Fco-workers in the unit who had
OL,11,Freceived the Snapchat messages and had
OL,12,Freported Corvan's actions to managers.
OL,13,FPolice were then alerted.
OL,15,FHe said her offending involved the
OL,16,F"degrading and humiliation of those
OL,17,Fwho were completely helpless to defend
OL,18,Fthemselves".
OL,26,@oD@AOUoD@dO]xD@AOUzD@KO]
OL,1,W~k4 jw=hw1 hw}h7}j7}            G6/16
OL,2,W/*% /*%/"-$+,*%/*%/*-'T(,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BNI NewsCClean Feed FThis Day
FL,419,410,140,120,000,100
PN,41807
SC,0007
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F418A1785327526
OL,3,CCare worker sentenced for sending
OL,4,Cdegrading Snapchat images of dementia
OL,5,Cpatients
OL,7,FDuring the hearing, Judge McGurgan
OL,8,Fsummarised victim impact statements
OL,9,Fprovided to the court by relatives of
OL,10,Fthe patients involved.
OL,12,FHe then sentenced Corvan to a two-year
OL,13,Fprobation order and 100 hours of
OL,14,Fcommunity service.
OL,16,FThe judge warned Corvan, who now works
OL,17,Ffor a grocery business, that if she
OL,18,Fbreached the order she would be
OL,19,Freturned to court and would face the
OL,20,Fimposition of a custodial sentence.
OL,1,W~k4 jw=hw1 hw}h7}j7}            G7/16
OL,2,W/*% /*%/"-$+,*%/*%/*-'T(,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BNI NewsCClean Feed FThis Day
FL,419,410,140,120,000,100
PN,41808
SC,0008
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F418A1785327526
OL,3,CCare worker sentenced for sending
OL,4,Cdegrading Snapchat images of dementia
OL,5,Cpatients
OL,7,FA barrister for the defendant told the
OL,8,Fcourt she had written a letter of
OL,9,Fapology to the families.
OL,11,FThe barrister said the letter said
OL,12,Fthat Corvan was "truly sorry" and
OL,13,Facknowledged that she could not expect
OL,14,Fto be forgiven but did express hope
OL,15,Fthat the families could see the
OL,16,F"sincerity of her regret".
OL,26,@tD@QOUtD@]O]xD@AOUxD@YO]
OL,1,W~k4 jw=hw1 hw}h7}j7}            G8/16
OL,2,W/*% /*%/"-$+,*%/*%/*-'T(,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BNI NewsCClean Feed FThis Day
FL,419,410,140,120,000,100
PN,41809
SC,0009
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F418A1785327526
OL,3,CCare worker sentenced for sending
OL,4,Cdegrading Snapchat images of dementia
OL,5,Cpatients
OL,7,FThe barrister added: "I just wish to
OL,8,Fbe quite clear that Ms Corvan is not
OL,9,Fin any way trying to minimise her
OL,10,Factions, and has the deepest regret
OL,11,Ffor the pain and suffering that both
OL,12,Fthe victims in this case and their
OL,13,Ffamilies and extended families and
OL,14,Floved ones have suffered as a result
OL,15,Fof her actions."
OL,26,@oD@VOUwD@PO]
OL,1,W~k4 jw=hw1 hw}h7}j7}            G9/16
OL,2,W/*% /*%/"-$+,*%/*%/*-'T(,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BNI NewsCClean Feed FThis Day
FL,419,410,140,120,000,100
PN,41810
SC,0010
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F418A1785327526
OL,3,CCare worker sentenced for sending
OL,4,Cdegrading Snapchat images of dementia
OL,5,Cpatients
OL,7,FAfter the sentencing hearing, the
OL,8,Ffamilies affected said in a statement:
OL,9,F"Our relatives were private, kind
OL,10,Findividuals who could not speak for
OL,11,Fthemselves in their final years, and
OL,12,Fwhat was done to them was a gross
OL,13,Fviolation of their basic human rights.
OL,15,F"While no sentence can undo the harm,
OL,16,Fwe are grateful for the
OL,17,Facknowledgement that this type of
OL,18,Fbehaviour is indeed criminal conduct
OL,19,Fand that justice can be served against
OL,20,Fthose who mock and torment the
OL,21,Fvulnerable.
OL,26,@qD@AOUwD@AOU
OL,1,W~k4 jw=hw1 hw}h7}j7}           G10/16
OL,2,W/*% /*%/"-$+,*%/*%/*-'T(,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BNI NewsCClean Feed FThis Day
FL,419,410,140,120,000,100
PN,41811
SC,0011
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F418A1785327526
OL,3,CCare worker sentenced for sending
OL,4,Cdegrading Snapchat images of dementia
OL,5,Cpatients
OL,7,F"Every caregiver must be held to the
OL,8,Fhighest standard of trust."
OL,10,FThe families said Corvan "sought
OL,11,Fentertainment in humiliating" patients
OL,12,Fwho were already "tormented every day
OL,13,Fthrough the slow and cruel loss of
OL,14,Ftheir ability to do even the most
OL,15,Fbasic personal tasks".
OL,26,@oD@AOUpD@[O]rD@ZOUsD@]O]tD@ROUwD@UO]
OL,1,W~k4 jw=hw1 hw}h7}j7}           G11/16
OL,2,W/*% /*%/"-$+,*%/*%/*-'T(,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BNI NewsCClean Feed FThis Day
FL,419,410,140,120,000,100
PN,41812
SC,0012
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F418A1785327526
OL,3,CCare worker sentenced for sending
OL,4,Cdegrading Snapchat images of dementia
OL,5,Cpatients
OL,7,F"At a point when our loved ones
OL,8,Fdepended on her to support them in
OL,9,Fmaking it through their final days,
OL,10,Fshe not only chose to mock and degrade
OL,11,Fthem but then distributed it through
OL,12,Fsocial media," they said.
OL,14,F"She took advantage of the fact that
OL,15,Four family members were suffering from
OL,16,Fa disease that meant they could not
OL,17,Feven communicate what they had endured.
OL,26,@oD@AOUtD@NO]vD@AOU
OL,1,W~k4 jw=hw1 hw}h7}j7}           G12/16
OL,2,W/*% /*%/"-$+,*%/*%/*-'T(,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BNI NewsCClean Feed FThis Day
FL,419,410,140,120,000,100
PN,41813
SC,0013
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F418A1785327526
OL,3,CCare worker sentenced for sending
OL,4,Cdegrading Snapchat images of dementia
OL,5,Cpatients
OL,7,F"We now live every day with the
OL,8,Fthoughts that our loved ones had no
OL,9,Fway of saying or showing how much of
OL,10,Fthe fear or the pain that she caused
OL,11,Flingered with them until their final
OL,12,Fdays.
OL,14,F"We are saddened by the seemingly lack
OL,15,Fof morals in this social media
OL,16,Fgeneration and hope that this
OL,17,Fsentencing today makes people stop and
OL,18,Fthink about their conduct online and
OL,19,Fhow they treat people.
OL,26,@oD@AOUvD@AOU
OL,1,W~k4 jw=hw1 hw}h7}j7}           G13/16
OL,2,W/*% /*%/"-$+,*%/*%/*-'T(,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BNI NewsCClean Feed FThis Day
FL,419,410,140,120,000,100
PN,41814
SC,0014
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F418A1785327526
OL,3,CCare worker sentenced for sending
OL,4,Cdegrading Snapchat images of dementia
OL,5,Cpatients
OL,7,F"It has been shown today that this is
OL,8,Fcriminal behaviour. If you are in a
OL,9,Fposition of trust and care and not
OL,10,Ftaking that position seriously, heed
OL,11,Fthis warning. Please stop and think `
OL,12,Fif that was your mother or father, how
OL,13,Fwould you want them to be treated?"
OL,15,FDetective Chief Inspector Claire
OL,16,FMcDonald from the Police Service of
OL,17,FNorthern Ireland said the victims in
OL,18,Fthe case were "some of the most
OL,19,Fvulnerable in our society".
OL,26,@oD@AOUuD@cO]zD@OOU{D@ZO]
OL,1,W~k4 jw=hw1 hw}h7}j7}           G14/16
OL,2,W/*% /*%/"-$+,*%/*%/*-'T(,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BNI NewsCClean Feed FThis Day
FL,419,410,140,120,000,100
PN,41815
SC,0015
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F418A1785327526
OL,3,CCare worker sentenced for sending
OL,4,Cdegrading Snapchat images of dementia
OL,5,Cpatients
OL,7,F"They and their families depended on
OL,8,Fformer health care assistant Ciara
OL,9,FCorvan to take care of them and they
OL,10,Ftrusted that she maintained their
OL,11,Fhealth and their dignity as part of
OL,12,Fher care role ` she did not," she said.
OL,14,F"The victims were subjected to
OL,15,Fdegrading and mocking behaviour.
OL,16,FCorvan took photographs and video
OL,17,Frecorded her victims on her mobile
OL,18,Fphone and then shared the imaging with
OL,19,Fdegrading comments via a social media
OL,20,Fmessaging app.
OL,26,@oD@AOUtD@]O]vD@AOU
OL,1,W~k4 jw=hw1 hw}h7}j7}           G15/16
OL,2,W/*% /*%/"-$+,*%/*%/*-'T(,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BNI NewsCClean Feed FThis Day
FL,419,410,140,120,000,100
PN,41816
SC,0016
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F418A1785327526
OL,3,CCare worker sentenced for sending
OL,4,Cdegrading Snapchat images of dementia
OL,5,Cpatients
OL,7,F"Corvan exploited their
OL,8,Fvulnerabilities, specifically their
OL,9,Flack of capacity and communication,
OL,10,Ffor her own entertainment. Today her
OL,11,Factions are proven criminal, in the
OL,12,Ffirst case of its kind for Northern
OL,13,FIreland."
OL,15,FCatch up with the latest UTV Live on
OL,16,FITVX
